+//  `Row<{c1 :: T1, ...}>` = TApp(Row, [TRecord]).  A bare `Table` / `Row`
+//  (a plain t-name, no app) denotes an unknown schema — the conservative
+//  "some table" used for data from unknown sources or dynamic column names.
+//
